  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening productive capacity of land reform settlements in Rio Grande do Norte</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Comisso Pastoral da Terra do Rio Grande do Norte (CPT-RN) will work with community associations to introduce low-cost infrastructure for farming with limited water resources in 10 settlements formed pursuant to Brazil&apos;s program of land reform in western Rio Grande do Norte. The infrastructure will benefit 500 farmers and 2,515 members of their families..</narrative>
  </description>
